<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχῆ</span></b> , Adv., common Prose form of
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχα, τριχῇ δασάμενος τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.39
				</span></i>
			 (though he also uses <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχα,</span>
			q. v.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. διείλοντο τὰς βασιλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					6.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				253c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.3.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. διαστήσασθαι τῷ λόγῳ πόλιν,
				διανεῖμαι τὸ στράτευμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				564c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				683d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς τοξότας τ. ἐποιήσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.8.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νενεμημένων τῶν ἀγαθῶν τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1098b13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in three ways, triply,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				51e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				23.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. διαστατός</span>
			<i>of three</i> dimensions, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.1.26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.1.6
			</span></i>.</div>
